BugReports: https://github.com/agrdatasci/climatrends/issues
Description: Computes climate indices for the analysis of climate trends 
    and for ecological and crop modelling: temperature and precipitation 
    indices (Aguilar et al. 2005 <doi:10.1029/2005JD006119>), growing 
    degree-days, late spring frost, crop-sensitive heat stress indices 
    (Challinor et al. 2016 <doi:10.1038/nclimate3061>) and reference 
    evapotranspiration. Indices are computed from local data or from daily 
    data fetched from 'NASA POWER' for each site, with start dates and 
    lengths that can differ between sites, as in decentralised on-farm trials.
